reparse-boundary-help = Both bounds are required. Dates include the whole end day; exact YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS[.fffffff] times include matching rows at both ends. Source wall-clock values have no timezone suffix. Stop at the first later timestamp. Strict UTF-8 only; other encodings and companion logs are unsupported. Read-ahead bytes may reach the file end before parsing finishes.
