reparse-invalid-range = The inclusive start must not follow the end. Equal times are allowed. Your draft was kept.
reparse-invalid-date = Use a valid source date or exact time in years 0001–9999, without timezone suffixes or more than seven fractional digits. Your source draft was kept.

